#### 4. **Cache Aggressively, Invalidate Carefully**

```csharp
// Cache decisions based on stability of attributes
public TimeSpan GetCacheDuration(AuthorizationRequest request)
{
    // User role changes infrequently: 5 minutes
    if (request.IsRoleBased)
        return TimeSpan.FromMinutes(5);

    // Resource ownership changes rarely: 2 minutes
    if (request.IsResourceBased)
        return TimeSpan.FromMinutes(2);

    // Time-based policies: 1 minute
    if (request.IsTimeSensitive)
        return TimeSpan.FromMinutes(1);

    // Context-sensitive: 30 seconds
    return TimeSpan.FromSeconds(30);
}
```

