#### Pitfall 2: **Fetching Attributes Synchronously in Hot Path**

**Problem:**
```csharp
// Slow: Fetch attributes on every request
var userAttributes = await _azureAd.GetUserAttributesAsync(userId); // 150ms
var resourceAttributes = await _database.GetResourceAsync(resourceId); // 200ms
// Total: 350ms per authorization check!
```

**Solution:**
```csharp
// Fast: Batch fetch and cache attributes
var userAttributes = await _cache.GetOrCreateAsync($"user:{userId}", async entry =>
{
    entry.AbsoluteExpirationRelativeToNow = TimeSpan.FromMinutes(5);
    return await _azureAd.GetUserAttributesAsync(userId);
}); // Cache hit: 1ms, Cache miss: 150ms (rare)
```

