#### Pitfall 3: **Ignoring Attribute Staleness**

**Problem:**
User's role changed 5 minutes ago, but cached attributes still show old role.

**Solution:**
```csharp
// Implement cache invalidation on attribute changes
public async Task UpdateUserRoleAsync(string userId, string newRole)
{
    await _userService.UpdateRoleAsync(userId, newRole);

    // Invalidate cached attributes
    await _cache.RemoveAsync($"user_attrs:{userId}");
    await _cache.RemoveAsync($"authz_decisions:*{userId}*"); // Wildcard delete

    // Publish event for distributed cache invalidation
    await _eventBus.PublishAsync(new UserAttributeChangedEvent
    {
        UserId = userId,
        ChangedAttribute = "role",
        NewValue = newRole
    });
}
```

